### 5. Login com senha incorreta (401)
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "marcos@gmail.com",
    "senha": "errada"
}

### 6. Login (guarda o token)
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "marcos@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123"
}

### 7. Listar Clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 8. Consultar Cliente por código
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 9. Atualizar Cliente 1
PUT http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "celular": "48999990000"
}

### 10. Cadastrar Console 1
POST http://localhost:3000/console
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "modelo": "PlayStation 5",
    "marca": "Sony",
    "numeroSerie": "PS5-0001",
    "tipoServico": "limpeza",
    "idCliente": 1
}

### 11. Cadastrar Console 2
POST http://localhost:3000/console
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "modelo": "Xbox Series X",
    "marca": "Microsoft",
    "numeroSerie": "XBX-0002",
    "tipoServico": "reparo",
    "idCliente": 2
}

### 12. Cadastrar Console 3
POST http://localhost:3000/console
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "modelo": "Nintendo Switch",
    "marca": "Nintendo",
    "numeroSerie": "NSW-0003",
