### 13. Listar Consoles
GET http://localhost:3000/consoles
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 14. Consultar Console por termo
GET http://localhost:3000/console/buscar/PS5-0001
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 15. Cadastrar Agendamento 1
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-11-10",
    "hora": "14:00:00",
    "idConsole": 1,
    "idCliente": 1
}

### 16. Cadastrar Agendamento 2
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-11-05",
    "hora": "10:30:00",
    "idConsole": 2,
    "idCliente": 2
}

### 17. Cadastrar Agendamento 3
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-11-15",
    "hora": "16:00:00",
    "idConsole": 3,
    "idCliente": 3
}

### 18. Atualizar Agendamento 1 (data 20/11)
PUT http://localhost:3000/agendamento/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-11-20"
}

### 19. Listar Agendamentos ordenados por data (05/11, 15/11, 20/11)
GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 20. Rota protegida sem token (401)
GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos

### 21. Deletar Cliente 3
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/3
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
